flowchart TD
    SearchStart([生命周期入口]) --> SearchRecovery[执行公共 journal 检查/修复；失败或中断在公共图内终止]
    SearchRecovery -->|成功；锁保持| SearchCommand[进入当前命令]

    SearchCommand --> SearchValidate[校验必填 keyword、agent 与可选 type]
    SearchValidate -->|失败| SearchFail[打印参数或 Agent/Adapter 错误] --> SearchExitError
    SearchValidate -->|成功| SearchCloudList[调用 Cloud List 获取带版本的全部 PowerRef]
    SearchCloudList -->|读取或解析失败| SearchFail
    SearchCloudList -->|成功| SearchFilter[在 lifecycle 中按 keyword 与可选 type 筛选]
    SearchFilter --> SearchPrint[打印匹配的云端 Power]
    SearchPrint --> SearchExitOK([释放锁并正常退出])
    SearchValidate -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted
    SearchCloudList -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted
    SearchPrint -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted
